Compute the headline stats of the attached fit by running the full fitting engine: damage (DPS with/without reload, volley, alpha, drone/fighter DPS), defense (EHP per layer, raw HP, effective resists), capacitor (capacity, peak recharge/load/delta, depletion time in seconds - a negative or huge value means stable), mobility (velocity, align time, mass, warp speed), fitting resources (CPU/powergrid output and free), and targeting (max locked targets, scan resolution, signature radius). Use `get_item` or `get_attr` for anything more specific.
